			<item>
				<title>Nexus security plugin</title>
				<link>https://www-staging.alwaldend.com/docs/projects/nexus_security_plugin/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www-staging.alwaldend.com/docs/projects/nexus_security_plugin/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This plugin allows you to perform a check every time an artifact is requested from a repository&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;links&#34;&gt;Links&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#links&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Source code: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/alwaldend/src/tree/master/projects/nexus_security_plugin&#34;&gt;https://github.com/alwaldend/src/tree/master/projects/nexus_security_plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#features&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A request handler that checks all requests to repositories&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Capability controlling the request handler&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A task that periodically updates the capability using a remote source&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.sonatype.com/products/sonatype-nexus-repository&#34;&gt;Sonatype Nexus 3&lt;/a&gt; plugin&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Java&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;flow&#34;&gt;Flow&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#flow&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www-staging.alwaldend.com/docs/projects/nexus_security_plugin/diagram.svg&#34; alt=&#34;diagram&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Nexus security plugin</title>
				<link>https://www-staging.alwaldend.com/projects/nexus_security_plugin/</link>
