				<guid>https://www-staging.alwaldend.com/projects/nexus_security_plugin/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;A plugin for Sonatype Nexus 3 that runs a check every time an artifact&#xA;is requested from a repository.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#features&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Artifact checks on repository requests&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Deployed as a Nexus 3 plugin&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
